CO2 class(es) with discharged battery: G &#8211; F." data-copyright="P90555153" data-pagetype="release" data-pageid="868150" data-mediakithash="2c1980407e67ed770f9e8b3cd306f6cc00d2726a" href="https://content.presspage.com/uploads/3240/6c0934c9-0300-4473-a151-e709dab0a073/800_P90555153_highRes_the-new-bmw-x3-30e-x.jpg?10000" data-attr-download-text="Λήψη" data-attr-download-low-res="Βελτιστοποιημένο (μικρότερο μέγεθος)" data-attr-download-high-res="Πρωτότυπο" data-attr-download-all-assets="Λήψη όλων των αρχείων" data-attr-hash='2bcf6efe546c5fde1077c220a44d65c018d057a2'><div class="pp_flexgallery_item" role="img" aria-label="The new BMW X3 30e xDrive - Studio. (06/2024)" style="background-image:url(https://content.presspage.com/uploads/3240/6c0934c9-0300-4473-a151-e709dab0a073/500_P90555153_highRes_the-new-bmw-x3-30e-x.jpg?10000);" title="The new BMW X3 30e xDrive - Studio. (06/2024)"></div></a><div class="pp_gallery_labels_container">
                                                    <div class="pp_gallery_label pp_gallery_title none">The new BMW X3 30e xDrive - Studio. (06/2024)</div>
                                                    <div class="pp_gallery_label pp_gallery_description none">Energy consumption &#8211; weighted, combined in the WLTP cycle: 
1.1 &#8211; 0.9 l/100 km (256.8 &#8211; 313.9 mpg imp) and 24.0 &#8211; 22.3 kWh/100 km. 
CO2 emissions from petrol &#8211; weighted, combined in the WLTP cycle: 26 &#8211; 21 g/km.
Petrol consumption with discharged battery, combined in the WLTP cycle: 7.9 &#8211; 7.2 l/100 km (35.8 &#8211; 39.2 mpg imp).
